<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued 30 million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,850.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	12.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.65 PCT		  GEARING	13.3 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 30.APR.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	30.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,770.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
